    "content": "<style type=\"text/css\">@media only screen {* { word-break: break-word; }}</style><style type=\"text/css\">@media screen and (max-width: 384px) { .mail-message-content { width: 414px !important; } }</style><style>@media only screen and (max-width:600px) {\n        .ck-padding-left-none {\n          padding-left: 0px !important;\n        }\n        .ck-padding-right-none {\n          padding-right: 0px !important;\n        }\n        .ck-padding-left-mobile-friendly {\n          padding-left: 18px !important;\n        }\n        .ck-padding-right-mobile-friendly {\n          padding-right: 18px !important;\n        }\n    }</style><style>@media only screen and (max-width:600px) {\n        .ck-mobile-font-size {\n          font-size: 50px !important;\n        }\n     }</style><!--[if mso]><style>.button-table { padding: 12px 0 }</style><![endif]--><table cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"width:100%;margin:0 auto;background-color:#ffffff\"><tbody><tr><td><style>\n  .email {\n    background: #ffffff !important;\n  }\n</style><div class=\"ck-section\" style=\"margin:0px auto 40px auto\"><center><table cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;margin:0 auto;max-width:640px\"><tbody><tr><td contenteditable=\"false\"></td><td width=\"640\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;background-size:cover;background-position:center;box-sizing:border-box;mso-padding-alt:36px 36px 0px 36px\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"><div class=\"ck-inner-section ck-padding-left-mobile-friendly ck-padding-right-mobile-friendly\" style=\"padding:36px 36px 0px 36px\"><div style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;max-width:640px\"><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Dear {{ subscriber.first_name }}</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Do you want to earn a seat at the table in your business?</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Do you want to get more involved in the business?</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Do you want to have more of an impact?</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Do you want to get promoted at your company?</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Our FP&amp;A best practice course is aimed at helping each of our students learn how to be an FP&amp;A expert and help them accelerate their career..</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">FP&amp;A is one of the few professions that has a 360-degree view of the business, which gives us the opportunity to become indispensable business partners.</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Our instructors, Paul Barnhurst and Ron Monteiro, have over 25 years of FP&amp;A experience and spent time in Director and VP roles.</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Please join our next cohort of FP&amp;A training for 4 amazing sessions on Apr 23,24,30 and May 1 (12-2.30pm est).</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><!--[if !mso]>--><table width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\"><a class=\"email-button\" href=\"https://www.thefpandaguy.com/fpa-course\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"border-color:#11363F;background-color:#11363F;box-sizing:border-box;border-style:solid;color:#fdfafa;display:inline-block;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;padding:18px 32px;margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:24px;border-radius:10px 10px 10px 10px\">Learn More</a></td></tr></tbody></table><!--<![endif]--><!--[if mso]><table class=\"button-table\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:12px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\"><tr><td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#11363F\" style=\"background-color:#11363F;overflow:hidden;padding:18px 32px\"><a class=\"email-button\" href=\"https://www.thefpandaguy.com/fpa-course\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"background-color:inherit;display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;border-style:solid;margin:0;color:#fdfafa;font-size:24px\" data-ck-element=\"button\">Learn More</a></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><![endif]--><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">As a student in our course, you will receive the following:</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><ul class=\"unordered_list\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;list-style-position:inside\"><li class=\"list_item\"><span>Access to Paul&#x27;s free digital courses worth $100.00</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>FP&amp;A guides and templates covering world-class analytics, best practices in budgeting, data visualization, and storytelling, worth $500.</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>A 30-minute one on one coaching call with Paul or Ron worth $150.</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>Frameworks and lessons that will help you become indispensable to your business partners.</span></li><li class=\"list_item\"><span>Recordings of every session. </span></li></ul><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Many of our students are reimbursed by their employers for this course, and we have a reimbursement template for download on our website.</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><!--[if !mso]>--><table width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\"><a class=\"email-button\" href=\"https://buy.stripe.com/5kA0423BGgoO30A3cn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"border-color:#11363F;background-color:#11363F;box-sizing:border-box;border-style:solid;color:#fdfafa;display:inline-block;text-align:center;text-decoration:none;padding:18px 32px;margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:24px;border-radius:10px 10px 10px 10px\"><strong>Buy the Course Today </strong></a></td></tr></tbody></table><!--<![endif]--><!--[if mso]><table class=\"button-table\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" style=\"margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:12px\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\"><tr><td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#11363F\" style=\"background-color:#11363F;overflow:hidden;padding:18px 32px\"><a class=\"email-button\" href=\"https://buy.stripe.com/5kA0423BGgoO30A3cn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"background-color:inherit;display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;border-style:solid;margin:0;color:#fdfafa;font-size:24px\" data-ck-element=\"button\"><strong>Buy the Course Today </strong></a></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><![endif]--><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Sincerely, </p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Paul Barnhurst and Ron Monteiro</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">Testimonials: </p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">\u200b</p><div style=\"padding:10px 20px;margin:0 0 20px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0;border-left-color:#000000;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-transform:none\" class=\"blockquotes\"><div class=\"blockquotes-line\">\u201cAmazing course! All 4 sessions added tremendous value to my role and team. They were all very relevant to not just F&amp;PA, but any Finance role. The visualizations really allowed me to understand how to display and share my story in a more understandable way (not just within finance). You both provided incredible tips, resources and examples that catered to everyone.&quot;</div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 20px;margin:0 0 20px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0;border-left-color:#000000;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-transform:none\" class=\"blockquotes\"><div class=\"blockquotes-line\">Jennifer Caron</div><div class=\"blockquotes-line\">CBU Manager at Mars Canada</div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 20px;margin:0 0 20px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0;border-left-color:#000000;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-transform:none\" class=\"blockquotes\"><div class=\"blockquotes-line\">&quot;Your course summarizes what takes many years to figure out by yourself and gives fresh new ideas. I absolutely loved it, you have a new fan!&quot;</div></div><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">    Mario Kozumplik</p><div style=\"padding:10px 20px;margin:0 0 20px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0;border-left-color:#000000;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-transform:none\" class=\"blockquotes\"><div class=\"blockquotes-line\">FP&amp;A Director, 2K</div><div class=\"blockquotes-line\">\u200b</div><div class=\"blockquotes-line\">&quot;Amazing sessions by Ron &amp; Paul. Incredible rapport between both of them. Valuable, practical and digestible content for us to get closer to the problems we are solving.</div></div><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">    Steve Groccia </p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-transform:none;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\" class=\"\">    Customer Operations, Mosaic</p></div></div></td><td contenteditable=\"false\"></td></tr></tbody></table><div><!--[if mso]><br /><br /><![endif]--></div></center></div><div class=\"ck-section\" style=\"margin:0px auto 0px auto\"><center><table cellPadding=\"0\" cellSpacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;margin:0 auto;max-width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td contenteditable=\"false\"></td><td width=\"100%\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;background-size:cover;background-position:center;box-sizing:border-box;mso-padding-alt:18px 36px 18px 36px\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\"><div class=\"ck-inner-section ck-padding-left-mobile-friendly ck-padding-right-mobile-friendly\" style=\"padding:18px 36px 18px 36px\"><div style=\"margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;max-width:520px\"><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-transform:none\" class=\"\">{{ address }}</p><p style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#353535;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-transform:none\" class=\"\">\u200b<a href=\"{{ unsubscribe_url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#0000ff\">Unsubscribe</a> \u00b7 <a href=\"{{ subscriber_preferences_url }}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#0000ff\">Preferences</a>\u200b</p></div></div></td><td contenteditable=\"false\"></td></tr></tbody></table></center></div><div class=\"ck-section ck-hide-in-public-posts\" style=\"margin:30px au